    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR COUNTRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From leader to golf ball, explore this well aged farm and find your way to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/extras/bbcbeb463dab9e049ec6662a0afa93bf.avif?t=1751875232\" data-has-big width=800 height=516 /></span><strong>HOW DO I SERVE OUR COUNTRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great question young one. This farm is all about precision and creativity. Use the various objects around you as tools for you to find your own way to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/extras/bc9cb7979e867b3a334c078c462cb612.poster.avif?t=1751875232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/extras/bc9cb7979e867b3a334c078c462cb612.webm?t=1751875232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/extras/bc9cb7979e867b3a334c078c462cb612.mp4?t=1751875232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>WHAT CAN I EXPECT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed run support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of the feel from  2D rage platformers into the 3D world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An EMOTIONAL experience</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR COUNTRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From leader to golf ball, explore this well aged farm and find your way to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/extras/bbcbeb463dab9e049ec6662a0afa93bf.avif?t=1751875232\" data-has-big width=800 height=516 /></span><strong>HOW DO I SERVE OUR COUNTRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great question young one. This farm is all about precision and creativity. Use the various objects around you as tools for you to find your own way to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/extras/bc9cb7979e867b3a334c078c462cb612.poster.avif?t=1751875232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/extras/bc9cb7979e867b3a334c078c462cb612.webm?t=1751875232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/extras/bc9cb7979e867b3a334c078c462cb612.mp4?t=1751875232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>WHAT CAN I EXPECT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed run support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of the feel from  2D rage platformers into the 3D world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An EMOTIONAL experience</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Find your way upwards and stand gloriously at the top.",
